[thin] Required fold-through inlet lip, diameter 14 mm by 0.60 mm axial thickness, contained flush in the wall's diameter 14.30 mm by 0.60 mm recess. The thin TPU lip flexes through the closed diameter 12 mm wall opening during factory insertion; the hard wall locates the cuff.
alternatives: A 3 mm lip exceeds its 0.60 mm recess and the cartridge's 0.25 mm face gap. Enlarging the complete wall opening removes cuff location. Changing the lip requires reconciling that fitted wall and cartridge interface.
