[thin] Required wall-conforming TPU collar and axial stop. The tapered collar grows from diameter 11.7 to 17.5 mm between Y3.6 and Y5.9, followed by the Y5.9..7.0 annular stop. Its short axial section is the flexible retaining collar fitted to the wall's matching ramp and stop; the keeper groove begins at Y7. This is a named flexible retention feature, not an ordinary enclosure wall. Installed retention remains physically unqualified.
alternatives: Making the outer stop 3 mm axially would move the keeper groove and rear collar or consume the fitted ramp. Both alternatives change the closed wall seat and insertion geometry. Preserve the named interface while retaining its physical qualification limit.
