[thin] Matched flexible sealing cuffs. The front diameter 11.70 mm and branch diameter 11.72 mm surround diameter 6.10 mm sealing lands for the diameter 6.35 mm tube, giving nominal radial stock 2.80 and 2.81 mm. The 0.25 mm radial entry chamfer leaves 2.55/2.56 mm at the mouths; oblique chords to these tapers give the other reported values. These local cuff dimensions follow the manually fitted TPU elbow article recorded in the dock README. That fit does not qualify this junction's pressure retention or lifetime.
alternatives: A 3 mm wall around the front land requires diameter 12.10 mm and conflicts with its diameter 12.00 mm rigid-wall opening. Thickening the free branch cuffs changes the accepted-fit cuff dimensions and compliance. A different seal or cuff needs its own fit basis rather than an unqualified scalar thickness change.
